    "htmlContent": "<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Invitation→Journal Welcome. This is a quiet moment to arrive. You do not need to perform or be Welcome anything. Simply notice what is here as you cross the threshold into this work. Below are four sets of simple questions. Each one corresponds to amove we will explore during ourtime together. Fornow, treat them as away to arrive. Take your time and simply write what comes. 1. Showing Up</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">How are you feeling as you arrive here?</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">What, if anything, did you need to set aside to behere? 2. Stepping Out Consider your thoughts right now. Do they feel tight or open?</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">TIGHT OPEN</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">a concept, away you ve used itoranythinglsethateels alive or res on ant or you If this is new to you, what has caught your attention or sparked curiosity?</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Show Up</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Step Out</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Walk Your Why</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Move On</p>"
