    "rawText": "Hooked When the story writes us Ata Glance What to protect The twoopening experiences, the per at in go om case and it debriefne private right sized hook, and the close. What it builds Recognition. Participants learn to notice when one part of experience is taking over and narrowing perspective, possibility, and choice. The Journey AUTOMATIC MEANING BOUBA/KIKI REVEAL FUSION+ RIGIDITY OPERATING ROOM YOURHOOKS SOWHAT? WHAT? QUIETCLOSE EMOTIONAL ARC Curiosity Play It getsaname Sobering Quiet and personal Lighter, and the cost is clear Steady, unresolved Short on rep a ratio nt me Start with rp are then read Holds Redirectand Bridgeseep Theoom Mapopenwhileyoufacilitateandmark In Your Back Pocket forquick recovery. Purpose Beinghooked is the loss of er spec ti ve andossibilitywhenonepartathought, emotion, role, story, situation, or system be com the whole and starts directing the action. It happens to everyone, andit starts with something necessary: the mind makes meaning constantly, and thatiswhat allows us tofunction.heriskisnot that we make meaning. It is that one piece of it can takeover, andwhen it does, our options narrow. That narrowing has a cost, and it iswhy this module matters. Fusion changes the tone of relationships and under mines psychological safetyt showsupindecisionmakingincollaborationinwell-beingand in the quality of everyday lifat work and athome. Under uncertainty, time pressure, and complexity, groups and strategies grow more fr a gi le and cultures less healthy. And that is the difficulty exactly: hooks aremost likely under the conditions thatmost need the wider view. This module'swork is recognition. Participants learn to see the pattern in themselves, between people, and across systems, and to notice what it costs It offers nofix, and that is del i be rate what the rest of motion al Agility teaches is how to respond and it lands better in a room that has felt why it is needed. By thendarticipanthouldeabletrecogizethatatnduookedascriptionfatra than a label for aperson, and notice what narrowing costs. What This Module Teaches Participants first experience how quickly themind as signs meaning. Only then do they receive language for fusion and rigidity. The Operating oo m case study showswhat narrowing can cost under uncertainty hierarchy t me ressureand complexity er son a reflection makes the pattern rec og ni z able without requiring public disclosure; What? So What?makes the cost visible; and Spot the Narrowing gives participants a portableway to notice it beyond theroom. Let theroom experience narrow ing before you explainit. Name the condition without rushing torelieveit. Hooked names a condition that Emotional Agility meets: one part of experience becomes too total and begins directing the action Its job isrciiaa understandyrsectiveandossiiltatterforelatrkrovideayreatacereconnectwwhatattrad act with more choice. EMOTIONALAGILITYPRACTITIONERGUIDE HOOKED-PRACTITIONER1",
    "htmlContent": "<div class=\"facilitator-synthesis-card\">\n  <div class=\"synthesis-header\">\n    <span class=\"synthesis-badge\">導師教學梳理</span>\n    <h4 class=\"synthesis-title\">單元 01 導師地圖：被情緒鉤住 (Hooked - The Room Map)</h4>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"synthesis-grid\">\n    <div class=\"synthesis-item\">\n      <div class=\"synthesis-item-title\">🎯 核心教學目標</div>\n      <div>引導學員識別四大常見的情緒鉤子（猴子心智、壓抑封瓶、反芻深陷、執著正確），看見被鉤住時喪失自主權的代價。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"synthesis-item\">\n      <div class=\"synthesis-item-title\">💡 導師心法與節奏</div>\n      <div>不要急著幫學員脫鉤（Hold the fix）！學員必須先親身體驗『被鉤住是多麼普遍的人性現象』，降低自我苛責。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"synthesis-item\">\n      <div class=\"synthesis-item-title\">🗣️ 關鍵話術與金句</div>\n      <div>DO/SAY: “What is a hook? A hook is when a thought, emotion, or story captures your attention and starts driving your behavior.”</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"synthesis-item\">\n      <div class=\"synthesis-item-title\">⚠️ 現場應變要點</div>\n      <div>學員容易陷入分析『是誰害我被鉤住』，導師需溫和拉回：『我們現在關注的是，當鉤子咬住時，你內在發生了什麼？』</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Hooked</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">When the story writes us</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Ata Glance What to protect The twoopening experiences, the per at in go om case and it debriefne private right sized hook, and the close. What it builds Recognition. Participants learn to notice when one part of experience is taking over and narrowing perspective, possibility, and choice.</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">The Journey</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">AUTOMATIC MEANING BOUBA/KIKI REVEAL FUSION+ RIGIDITY OPERATING ROOM YOURHOOKS SOWHAT? WHAT? QUIETCLOSE</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">EMOTIONAL ARC</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Curiosity Play It getsaname Sobering Quiet and personal Lighter, and the cost is clear Steady, unresolved Short on rep a ratio nt me Start with rp are then read Holds Redirectand Bridgeseep Theoom Mapopenwhileyoufacilitateandmark In Your Back Pocket forquick recovery.</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Purpose</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Beinghooked is the loss of er spec ti ve andossibilitywhenonepartathought, emotion, role, story, situation, or system be com the whole and starts directing the action. It happens to everyone, andit starts with something necessary: the mind makes meaning constantly, and thatiswhat allows us tofunction.heriskisnot that we make meaning. It is that one piece of it can takeover, andwhen it does, our options narrow. That narrowing has a cost, and it iswhy this module matters. Fusion changes the tone of relationships and under mines psychological safetyt showsupindecisionmakingincollaborationinwell-beingand in the quality of everyday lifat work and athome. Under uncertainty, time pressure, and complexity, groups and strategies grow more fr a gi le and cultures less healthy. And that is the difficulty exactly: hooks aremost likely under the conditions thatmost need the wider view. This module'swork is recognition. Participants learn to see the pattern in themselves, between people, and across systems, and to notice what it costs It offers nofix, and that is del i be rate what the rest of motion al Agility teaches is how to respond and it lands better in a room that has felt why it is needed. By thendarticipanthouldeabletrecogizethatatnduookedascriptionfatra than a label for aperson, and notice what narrowing costs.</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">What This Module Teaches</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Participants first experience how quickly themind as signs meaning. Only then do they receive language for fusion and rigidity. The Operating oo m case study showswhat narrowing can cost under uncertainty hierarchy t me ressureand complexity er son a reflection makes the pattern rec og ni z able without requiring public disclosure; What? So What?makes the cost visible; and Spot the Narrowing gives participants a portableway to notice it beyond theroom. Let theroom experience narrow ing before you explainit. Name the condition without rushing torelieveit. Hooked names a condition that Emotional Agility meets: one part of experience becomes too total and begins directing the action Its job isrciiaa understandyrsectiveandossiiltatterforelatrkrovideayreatacereconnectwwhatattrad act with more choice.</p>"
