    "rawText": "What You'll Explore We all gethooked. Athought, feling, ole, group story, or even the situation itself takes over:“I am this”“we are that, and our options shrink. In thismodule, youll explore what it means tonotice those moments, and how rigidityshowsupinyourself, in the people you support, and across the systems you touch. Matters Why It Whenaling, ought role or yr irc um stan ct a towriteourbehavior-fusing uswith the experience- perspective collapses and options narrow. Fusion changes the tone of relationships and undermines psychological safety, giving way to defense or avoidance. People feel this strain acrossdecision-making, collaboration, well-being, and the quality of everyday life at work and at home. Under uncertainty, tmepressure, and complexity, groups and strategies grow more fragile and cultures less healthy. Step Out Show Up Walk Your Why Move On @2026SUSANDAVID·Emotional Agility@·VERSION2.0",
    "htmlContent": "<p class=\"article-paragraph\">What You'll</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Explore</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">We all gethooked. Athought, feling, ole, group story, or even the situation itself takes over:“I am this”“we are that, and our options shrink. In thismodule, youll explore what it means tonotice those moments, and how rigidityshowsupinyourself, in the people you support, and across the systems you touch.</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Matters</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Why It Whenaling, ought role or yr irc um stan ct a towriteourbehavior-fusing uswith the experience- perspective collapses and options narrow. Fusion changes the tone of relationships and undermines psychological safety, giving way to defense or avoidance. People feel this strain acrossdecision-making, collaboration, well-being, and the quality of everyday life at work and at home. Under uncertainty, tmepressure, and complexity, groups and strategies grow more fragile and cultures less healthy.</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Step Out Show Up</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Walk Your Why</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Move On</h3>"
