    "rawText": "PIRRN Powerful Question Whatwould be helpful toname here? Pocket Practice Sawubona in In60 secondsor less Practice Why this is powerful: Being genuinely seen lowers defensive ne ss and invites candor, which immediately improve s the conversation. Say:“I want to see this clearly. What do you need me to know right now?\" SHOWING UP",
