    "lineCount": 16,
    "rawText": "Write to See Me Continued This expressive writingcan helpyou make sense of something that already happened, or prepare for something you know is coming. Writefor10-15 minutes about something thatmatters toyou: a challenge, a tension, a loss, a decision ahead, a change inrole. Write freely and honestly. Don'tedit. Justwrite like no one isreading. Youmight consider: .What's happeningor what's coming .What you're noticing about howyou feel What this situation might be asking of you Show Up Step Out Walk Your Why Move On 58",
    "htmlContent": "<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Write to See Me</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Continued</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">This expressive writingcan helpyou make sense of something that already happened, or prepare for something you know is coming. Writefor10-15 minutes about something thatmatters toyou: a challenge, a tension, a loss, a decision ahead, a change inrole. Write freely and honestly. Don'tedit. Justwrite like no one isreading. Youmight consider: .What's happeningor what's coming .What you're noticing about howyou feel What this situation might be asking of you</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Show Up</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Step Out</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Walk Your Why</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Move On 58</p>"
