    "photoUrl": "/practitioner_guide/photos/PG_Page_070_WalkingYourWhy_Intro_IMG_5670.JPG",
    "lineCount": 10,
    "rawText": "Likea gymnastwith a strong core, when you have a deep inner sense of yourvalues, you can move fluidly and gracefully through whatever life brings. You don't lose yourbalance when the crowd gasps or the music shifts; you adjust and you land because your str eng h comes from within. By knowing whoyou are and what you stand for, you come to life's choiceswith themost powerful tool of all: your full self. This iswalking your why.",
