    "rawText": "Values Traps Three Patterns to Notice Values as Avoidance Using a value to sidestep discomfort. \"'m being caring”-—to avoid necessary feedback. Quick test: Does this move truly honor my value, orisitjust sparing me in this moment? Goals Disguised as Values Mistaking a destination fora direction. “Ivalue being number one”—— which is a goal, not a direction. Quicktest: What quality of action would I bring, whether or not Ihit the outcome? Values as Identity Holding a value so tightly it becomes identity, and starts to contradict itself. \"Ivalue belonging\"—and then excluding thosewho think differently. Quick test: Am I living the value, or protecting my ego? A trap I want to notice in myself: Show Up Walk Your Why Move On 2026SUSANDAVID·Emotional Agility@·VERSION 2.0 86",
    "htmlContent": "<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Values Traps Three Patterns to Notice</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Values as Avoidance</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Using a value to sidestep discomfort.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"article-quote\">&quot;'m being caring”-—to avoid</blockquote>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">necessary feedback.</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Quick test: Does this move</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">truly honor my value, orisitjust sparing me in this moment?</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Goals Disguised as Values</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Mistaking a destination fora direction.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"article-quote\">“Ivalue being number one”——</blockquote>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">which is a goal, not a direction.</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Quicktest: What quality of action</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">would I bring, whether or not Ihit the outcome?</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Values as Identity</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Holding a value so tightly it becomes identity, and starts to contradict itself.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"article-quote\">&quot;Ivalue belonging&quot;—and</blockquote>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">then excluding thosewho think differently. Quick test: Am I living the value, or protecting my ego? A trap I want to notice in myself:</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Show Up</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Walk Your Why</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Move On</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">86</p>"
