    "photoUrl": "/practitioner_guide/photos/PG_Page_112_MovingOn_IMG_5732.JPG",
    "lineCount": 20,
    "rawText": "Pocket Practice Take This Job In 2minutesor less and Tweak It Mostroles are notre designed from above; they arereshaped from within, one small tweak at a time. Researchers call it jobcrafting. Use when: A task on repeat drains more than it gives, in a roleyou're keeping, fornow. The taskcan beoneof yours, oroneyou sharewih others. How: Pick one taskyou'll do anyway this week, and make one tweak: Tweak the how —fold in a strength: your way of explaining, organizing, or connecting. Tweak thewho—do one partof itwith, or for, someone. Shared load is lighter; witnessed workmeans more. Tweak the whyname the value the task quietly serves. Debrief Aweek in, ask: which tweak held, andwhat did it change? Small crafting, repeated, inds thewant-toinside the havetond moments become movements. Show Up Step Out Walk Your Why Move On 112 @2026 Susan David·Emotional Agility@VERSION2.0",
    "htmlContent": "<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Pocket Practice</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Take This Job In 2minutesor less</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">and Tweak It Mostroles are notre designed from above; they arereshaped from within, one small tweak at a time. Researchers call it jobcrafting. Use when: A task on repeat drains more than it gives, in a roleyou're keeping, fornow. The taskcan beoneof yours, oroneyou sharewih others. How: Pick one taskyou'll do anyway this week, and make one tweak: Tweak the how —fold in a strength: your way of explaining, organizing, or connecting. Tweak thewho—do one partof itwith, or for, someone. Shared load is lighter; witnessed workmeans more. Tweak the whyname the value the task quietly serves. Debrief Aweek in, ask: which tweak held, andwhat did it change? Small crafting, repeated, inds thewant-toinside the havetond moments become movements.</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Show Up</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Step Out</p>\n<h3 class=\"article-heading\">Walk Your Why</h3>\n<p class=\"article-paragraph\">Move On</p>"
